(1201502,23064,1708,'Grey Marshjumper','A nimble frog from the marshlands, perfect for traversing wetlands.'),
(1201503,23065,1708,'Blue Marshjumper','An agile frog known for its brilliant blue skin.'),
(1201504,23066,1708,'Green Marshjumper','This marshland frog’s green hue blends perfectly with swamp environments.'),
(1201505,23067,1708,'Swamper','An adaptable amphibian, born for life in the murky waters of swamps.'),
(1201506,23068,1708,'Black War Scorpion','A fierce, armored scorpion used by those who crave power.'),
(1201507,23069,1708,'Ember War Scorpion','With a shell like burning embers, this scorpion strikes with fiery vengeance.'),
(1201508,23070,1708,'Emerald War Scorpion','This emerald-hued beast is both majestic and dangerous.'),
(1201509,23071,1708,'Treebeard the Ancient','An ancient tree guardian, offering protection and wisdom.'),
(1201510,23072,1708,'Squeakers','A mischievous rodent mount, always ready for an adventure.'),
(1201511,23073,1708,'Aquamarine Greatwyrm','A majestic sea wyrm, its scales shimmer like the ocean.'),
(1201512,23074,1708,'Golden Koi','This giant koi glides through water and land with unmatched grace.'),
(1201513,23075,1708,'Enraged Bloodbeast','Fueled by fury, this beast charges into battle with a vengeance.'),
(1201514,23076,1708,'Mossy Bloodbeast','Covered in moss, this creature blends perfectly with forest terrain.'),
(1201515,23077,1708,'D.L.U. Rocket','A steam-powered rocket designed for the thrill-seeker.'),
(1201516,23078,1708,'Golden Yak','A regal yak, treasured for its strength and golden coat.'),
(1201517,23079,1708,'Nert’s Steampounder','A steam-powered contraption built for both speed and strength.'),
(1201518,23080,1708,'Sewer Rat','A scrappy rodent mount, perfect for navigating city underbellies.'),
(1201519,23081,1708,'Blue Snapback Scuttler','A swift crab with a sturdy blue shell.'),
(1201520,23082,1708,'Orange Snapback Scuttler','This crab’s orange shell stands out in any environment.'),
(1201521,23083,1708,'Reanimated Amani Raptor','Revived from death, this raptor’s fury knows no bounds.'),
(1201522,23084,1708,'Gilded Zandalari Raptor','Adorned with gold, this raptor is a treasure of the Zandalari.'),
(1201523,23085,1708,'Pig of Fortune','A lucky mount, rumored to bring good fortune to its rider.'),
(1201524,23086,1708,'Green Gargantuan Murloc','A giant green murloc, surprisingly loyal to its rider.'),
(1201525,23087,1708,'Black Gargantuan Murloc','This massive murloc prowls with an ominous presence.'),
(1201526,23088,1708,'Blue Gargantuan Murloc','A rare, blue-scaled giant murloc, ready for any adventure.'),
(1201527,23089,1708,'Orange Gargantuan Murloc','Its vibrant orange scales make this murloc a standout.'),
(1201528,23090,1708,'Purple Gargantuan Murloc','This majestic murloc commands attention with its purple hue.'),
(1201529,23091,7960,'Black Crane','A graceful black-feathered crane, symbolizing balance and serenity.'),
(1201530,23092,7960,'Ivory Crane','With its pristine white feathers, this crane is a vision of purity.'),
(1201531,23093,7960,'Pink Crane','A rare and beautiful crane with a soft pink plumage.'),
(1201532,23094,1708,'D.L.U. Zeppelin','An airship built for speed and high-altitude adventure.'),
(1201533,23095,1708,'Golden Foxwyvern','A majestic wyvern with shimmering golden fur and wings.'),
(1201534,23096,1708,'Essence of Zalmos','An ethereal creature carrying the power of Zalmos within.'),
(1201535,23097,1708,'Serpent of Ula-Tek','A sacred serpent, blessed by the goddess Ula-Tek.'),
(1201536,23098,1708,'Serpent of C\'Thun','This ancient serpent carries the whispers of C\'Thun’s power.'),
(1201537,23099,1708,'Serpent of Yogg-Saron','A terrifying serpent touched by Yogg-Saron’s dark influence.'),
(1201538,23100,1708,'Serpent of the Unknown Gods','Mysterious and powerful, this serpent’s origins remain a mystery.'),
(1201539,23101,1708,'Hand of Icecrown','An undead mount, raised to serve the Lich King’s will.'),
(1201540,23102,1708,'Hand of Menethil','This mount bears the strength of the fallen kingdom of Lordaeron.'),
(1201541,23103,1708,'Hand of Death','A terrifying mount, shrouded in darkness and decay.'),
(1201542,23104,1708,'Shu-Zen, Faithful Companion','A loyal companion, offering comfort and courage in battle.'),
(1201543,23105,1708,'Celestial Fox','A mystical fox, adorned with the power of the stars.'),
(1201544,23106,1708,'Celestial Rabbit','This rabbit sparkles with celestial energy, hopping gracefully across the land.'),
(1201545,23107,1708,'Loremaster’s Mouse','A tiny but wise mount, perfect for those who seek knowledge.'),
(1201546,23108,1708,'Celestial Tiger','A majestic tiger infused with the energy of the heavens.'),
(1201547,23109,1708,'Honeyback Harvester','A bee mount, prized for its sweet nature and loyal heart.'),
(1201548,23110,7960,'Red Thalassian Hawkstrider','Those royal Hawkstriders bear the colors of the Sunstrider dynasty.'),
(1201549,23111,7960,'Black Thalassian Hawkstrider','Black feathers of these Hawkstriders mourn the fallen of Quel\'Thalas.'),
(1201550,23112,7960,'Azure Thalassian Hawkstrider','These magnificent birds got their blue mantle thanks to the arcane magics of Quel\'Thalas.'),
(1201551,23113,7960,'Green Thalassian Hawkstrider','Once a common creature in Thalassian forests, now a dying breed.'),
(1201552,23114,7960,'Violet Thalassian Hawkstrider','Mages of Dalaran have a particular fondness for these extraordinary Hawkstriders.'),
(1201553,23115,7960,'Ivory Thalassian Hawkstrider','Rarest of the Hawkstriders, rumored to inhabit the mountains of Zul\'Aman.'),
(1201554,23116,7960,'Victorious Thalassian Hawkstrider','Felo\'melorn! Quel\'Thalas shall be ours once again!'),
(1201555,23117,7961,'Grey Riding Elekk','The elusive Elekks are rumored to inhabit the easternmost shores of Kalimdor.'),
(1201556,23118,7961,'Purple Riding Elekk','The elusive Elekks are rumored to inhabit the easternmost shores of Kalimdor.'),
(1201557,23119,1708,'Blue Wind Rider','Swift and loyal, this Wind Rider glides through Outland’s skies with ease.'),
(1201558,23120,1708,'Tawny Wind Rider','This hardy Wind Rider, with its warm tones, blends with the golden plains of Outland.'),
(1201559,23121,1708,'Green Wind Rider','Favored by scouts, this green-feathered Wind Rider is swift and sure.'),
(1201560,23122,1708,'Outlandish Nether Ray','Ethereal and strange, the Outlandish Nether Ray drifts through the skies of Outland.'),
(1201561,23123,1708,'Draenic Nether Ray','A common sight over Draenei lands, this Nether Ray is a majestic flier.');
