(1201811,48660,1703,115,'Spectral Steed','The echo of a dream, made real.','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.'),
(1201812,48670,0,2328,'Lightforged Dragonhawk','A radiant dragonhawk blessed by holy fire, its wings blaze with the unyielding light of the Lightforged.','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.'),
(1201813,48671,0,1634,'Lovely Lavender Squirrel','This charming lavender-furred squirrel carries an air of whimsy, as if it wandered out of a dream.','Increases speed based on your Riding skill.'),
