(2302,-1,589,434,0,-42000,-6500,0,0,0,0,0,1,1,'Frostmane Tribe','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',16777214,'The Frostmane is a tribe of Ice Trolls making a meager living within Dun Morogh at odds with the Dwarven and Gnomish inhabitants of the region.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',16777214),
