(2307,-1,1023,0,0,-42000,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,1,'Brood of Deathwing','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',16777214,'The children of what was once Neltharion, the Earth Warder. The Black Dragonflight only seeks to consume and corrupt the world while serving their insane dark master.','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','',16777214),
